        "summary": "Gets a site's redirect settings (defaults when unsaved).",
        "description": "Returns the redirect settings for the site, including the AutoRedirectOnMove flag. When no settings row has been saved the response reflects the default value (AutoRedirectOnMove = true).",
        "operationId": "GetCmsRedirectSettings",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "siteId",
            "in": "path",
